{"chunk_id": "cb7e72faef13", "text": "Lomasa recounts how the celestial twin physicians, the Aswins, encounter Sukanya just after bathing and marvel at her beauty. Learning she is the devoted wife of the aged sage Chyavana, they tempt her to abandon him, promising pleasure and youth. Sukanya refuses, affirming her fidelity, but relays their proposal to Chyavana: the twins will restore his youth if she later chooses among the three of them. Chyavana agrees. After all three emerge from a sacred pool in identical youthful forms, Sukanya correctly recognizes and chooses her husband, proving her loyalty. Grateful, Chyavana promises the Aswins a share of the sacred Soma. When King Saryati later performs a sacrifice, Chyavana attempts to grant them this privilege, provoking Indra\u2019s objection and setting up a confrontation over whether the Aswins deserve divine status.\nSukanya remains faithful as the Aswins restore Chyavana\u2019s youth; Chyavana later defies Indra to grant the Aswins a share of Soma.\nThemes: marital fidelity, divine transformation, reciprocity and gratitude, status of the Aswins, defiance of Indra", "vector": [0.027265476062893867, -0.009485740214586258, 0.009740621782839298, -0.010085057467222214, -0.04218640178442001, 0.020473217591643333, -0.02887743152678013, -0.008052890188992023, -0.013405410572886467, -0.024716656655073166, 0.01419072225689888, 0.020914094522595406, 0.01740085706114769, 0.005273300223052502, 0.004990863148123026, -0.0022836041171103716, 0.04789024591445923, -0.020307889208197594, 0.026053063571453094, -0.020486993715167046, -0.015141363255679607, 0.0041469973511993885, -0.011421465314924717, 0.008562654256820679, -0.02306336909532547, 0.024854430928826332, 0.0026314835995435715, -0.02973162941634655, 0.012509879656136036, -0.009981726296246052, -0.01629866473376751, -0.02482687495648861, -0.002733091823756695, -0.013205638155341148, -0.015279137529432774, -0.005090749356895685, -0.009878396056592464, -0.01439738366752863, 0.0